[TEST] Please perform and report the results of electromyography (EMG) with nerve conduction studies (NCS), with attention to:  
- Spontaneous activity (fibrillations, positive sharp waves, fasciculations);  
- Motor unit action potential (MUAP) morphology (short-duration, small-amplitude MUAPs suggest myopathy; large, polyphasic MUAPs suggest neurogenic);  
- Recruitment pattern (early, full, or reduced).

